    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has been plagued by eternal darkness by the Lich King. Shen and his companions go on a journey to find powerful allies, destroy the monters ravegening their home, find cures for their eternal status effects and most importantly defeat the Lich King to restore light to their dark world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192630/extras/1ad0092abf13219ab9b3301acec67c90.avif?t=1749586655\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has been plagued by eternal darkness by the Lich King. Shen and his companions go on a journey to find powerful allies, destroy the monters ravegening their home, find cures for their eternal status effects and most importantly defeat the Lich King to restore light to their dark world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192630/extras/1ad0092abf13219ab9b3301acec67c90.avif?t=1749586655\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Status Effect is a Story Rich, Turn-Based Action RPG with unique mechanics like fast action input combos that string together to make rewarding and engaging fights, a dodge mechanic that; if you land it, can allow you to avoid all damage in the game and a huge fantasy open world to explore!",
